<title>LITHUANIA: VILNIAUS PLANS ASSET MANAGEMENT FIRM.</title>
<headline>VILNIAUS PLANS ASSET MANAGEMENT FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Vilniaus Bank said on Monday that it was planning to start an asset management company before the end of the year.  </p>
<p>&quot;We are planning to found an asset managment firm by the end of the year,&quot; the chairman of the bank, Julius Niedvaras, told a news conference.</p>
<p>The bank started an asset management department in June as well as an investment banking department, Niedvaras said.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
